    "sections": {
        "description": "A Startup Consultant plays a crucial role in shaping emerging ventures by delivering strategic direction across business, finance, and corporate growth. Acting as a link between ideas and execution, the consultant often works alongside an agency, consulting teams, and technology partners to build strong market positioning and scalable progress. Their expertise covers financial planning, investments, branding, and operations, making them valuable for modern startups. From a design perspective, a Startup Consultant’s digital presence should feel modern, minimal, and refined. A clean and elegant layout helps build trust with clients and investors. With responsive, mobile-friendly, and retina-ready design, the platform ensures a smooth experience across devices. The interface stays user-friendly and engaging with subtle animations and visuals. Built with optimized code and strong performance standards, it delivers fast loading and secure functionality. As a multipurpose consulting solution, it fits corporate agency, finance firms, and consulting businesses, offering flexible customization, key sections, and clear calls to action for better client conversion."
    },
